Надо добавить энергии до 50 Вт:

Set the module parameter by editing the /etc/modprobe.d/iomemory-vsl4.conf file and changing the value for the external_power_override parameter.
Example:
options iomemory-vsl4 external_power_override=<SN-value>:<mW-value>
Where the <SN-value>:<mW-value> for this parameter is a comma-separated list of value pairs with adapter serial numbers and the maximum amount of power each device should pull (in milliwatts), например 1149D0969:50000

<SN-value> можно получить из fio-status.

После этого надо перезагрузить драйвер. Сделайте сначала в DS-е.

................................................................................

[root@ds-db-tst ~]# vim +view /etc/modprobe.d/iomemory-vsl4.conf

# To keep ioDrive from auto loading at boot when using udev, uncomment below
# blacklist iomemory-vsl4

# disable auto attach
# options iomemory-vsl4 auto_attach=0

# disable parallel attach for multiple cards
# options  iomemory-vsl4 parallel_attach=0

# To allow the ioDrive driver to load on SLES11, set "allow_unsupported_modules 1" in /etc/modprobe.d/unsupported-modules
options iomemory-vsl4 external_power_override=1424G0377:50000

